      "statement": "_provision_via_docker requires is_docker_available (the docker CLI present and 'docker info' succeeding), reuses a single named container 'ice-postgres' (starting it if stopped, no-op if running, docker run -d if absent), uses the pgvector/pgvector:pg16 image rather than plain postgres, and does not call _create_role_and_db since the official image auto-creates the configured role/database from its POSTGRES_USER/PASSWORD/DB env vars.",
